<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>주간 기록</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="container">
      <h1>주간 기록</h1>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>완료율과 피로도</h2>
        <p>이번 주 생성한 작업: <strong><%= stats.createdCount %></strong></p>
        <p>이번 주 완료한 작업: <strong><%= stats.completedCount %></strong></p>
        <p>완료율: <strong><%= stats.completionRate %>%</strong></p>
        <p>피로도 기록 - 낮음: <%= stats.fatigueBuckets.low %>, 보통: <%= stats.fatigueBuckets.medium %>, 높음: <%= stats.fatigueBuckets.high %></p>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>자주 미뤄지는 난이도</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>쉬움: <%= stats.postponedDifficulty.easy %></li>
          <li>보통: <%= stats.postponedDifficulty.medium %></li>
          <li>어려움: <%= stats.postponedDifficulty.hard %></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <nav>
        <a href="/">홈</a>
        <a href="/analysis">분석 결과</a>
      </nav>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
